{
  "id": "01_5375",
  "type": "item",
  "name": {
    "ja": "HG 1/144 ボリノーク・サマーン",
    "en": "HG 1/144 Bolinok Samaan"
  },
  "price": {
    "amount": 3520,
    "currency": "JPY",
    "taxIncluded": true,
    "taxRate": 10
  },
  "releaseDate": {
    "ja": "2024年11月30日 (土)",
    "year": 2024,
    "month": 11,
    "day": 30
  },
  "targetAge": 8,
  "scale": "1/144",
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士Ｚガンダム』より、「ボリノーク・サマーン」を最新ギミックを搭載しHGで商品化！",
      "en": "From \"Mobile Suit Z Gundam \", \" Borinok Samaan\" is commercialized in HG with the latest gimmick!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「専用シールド」はクロー部分の可動ギミックに加え、先端のビーム出力部など細かなディテールも再現。",
      "en": "• In addition to the movable gimmick of the claw part, the \"Special Seal Do\" also reproduces fine details such as the beam output part at the tip."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「専用シールド」の裏に格納しているグリップにエフェクトパーツを取り付けることで「ビーム・トマホーク」や「ビーム・サーベル」が再現可能。",
      "en": "• \"Beam Tomahawk \" and \" Beam Saber \" can be reproduced by attaching effect parts to the grip stored on the back of the \" Special Seal\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩アーマーに「炸裂弾ランチャー」発射再現用の展開ギミックを搭載。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a deployment gimmick on the shoulder armor to reproduce the firing of the \"explosive bullet launcher\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• レドームの“発光状態”を表現する頭部パーツが付属。「リフレクションカット」と「シール」により、特徴的なレドームの輝きを差し替え式で再現。",
      "en": "• A head part is included to express the radome's \"light-emitting state \". \" Reflection cut \" and \" Seal\" reproduce the characteristic shine of the radome with replacement."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部はボール可動に加え、首の基部に可動軸を設けることで、大きく前後へスイングが可能。",
      "en": "• In addition to the ball movable head, a movable axis is provided at the base of the neck, allowing it to swing back and forth."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩に引き出し機構を搭載し、腕部の可動範囲を拡大。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a pull-out mechanism on the shoulder to expand the range of motion of the arm."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 高い機動性の要となるバックパックは、複数のボールジョイントにより個別に可動。",
      "en": "• The backpack, which is the key to high mobility, can be moved individually using multiple ball joints."
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
    {
      "ja": "頭部パーツ（発光状態）×1",
      "en": "Head parts (light emitting state) x 1"
    },
    {
      "ja": "エフェクトパーツ×1式",
      "en": "Effect parts x 1"
    },
    {
      "ja": "ハンドパーツ×1式",
      "en": "Hand parts x 1 set"
    },
    {
      "ja": "シール×1",
      "en": "Seal×1"
    }
  ],
